            log_and_alert(data)
```

This code snippet provides a basic framework for building a network monitoring platform. It includes functions for device discovery, SSH connection pooling, and monitoring devices. The actual implementation of discovery mechanisms, data parsing, and external integrations would require more detailed coding based on specific requirements and tools available in the environment.']

