To complete the implementation, you would need to fill in the logic for subscribing to packets, filtering by source IP or protocol type, and handling real-time data inconsistencies and network interruptions. Additionally, you should implement comprehensive unit tests and stress tests to ensure the library performs well under various conditions.']

